<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">WeaveTime: Stream from Earlier Frames into Emergent Memory in VideoLLMs</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Yulin Zhang
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>ShanghaiTech University
</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Cheng Shi
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>School of Computing and Data Science, The University of Hong Kong<span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Project Page: <a href="https://zhangyl4.github.io/publications/weavetime/" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_medium">https://zhangyl4.github.io/publications/weavetime/</a></span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Sibei Yang
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author"><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
